---
link: https://github.com/alexmercer/ai-cv-parser
technologies: TypeScript, Astro, OpenAI, Markdoc
---
An open-source developer resume template designed to be easily read by humans and easily parsed by LLM-based AI Agents.

- Generates both a beautiful responsive web page and a raw, clean markdown representation of the CV at `/cv.md`.
- Fully integrated with Keystatic CMS for local file-based content management.
